	measure 'Referrals Created This Financial Year' = ```

			VAR financial_year_start =
			    DATE ( YEAR ( TODAY () ) - IF ( MONTH ( TODAY () ) < 4, 1, 0 ), 4, 1 )
			RETURN
			    CALCULATE (
			        [Total Referrals],
			        DATESBETWEEN ( 'dim_date'[date], financial_year_start, TODAY () )
			    )

			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 04b97ac1-cbb1-4f2c-834a-69a543ee8673

	measure 'Referrals Currently Active' = ```

