	measure 'Referrals With Multiple Provider Assignments' = ```

			COUNTROWS (
			    FILTER (
			        VALUES ( 'fact_referral_provider'[referral_id] ),
			        CALCULATE ( DISTINCTCOUNT ( 'fact_referral_provider'[provider_id] ) ) > 1
			    )
			)

			```
