	measure 'Draft Offers With Activity Since Creation' = ```

			CALCULATE (
			    [Offers Submitted],
			    FILTER (
			        'fact_offer',
			        LOWER ( COALESCE ( 'fact_offer'[offer_status], "" ) ) = "draft"
			            && 'fact_offer'[offer_reviewed_date] > 'fact_offer'[offer_submitted_date]
			    )
			)

			```
		formatString: 0
